      removable: 1
    - source: C
      destination: F
      removable: 1
    - source: C
      destination: G
      removable: 1
    required: []
  - title: Build a tree
    objective: Root A. Connect A to B and C; connect B to D and E.
    lesson: 'Select the parent first, then the child. Tap CONNECT. Each non-root
      node needs exactly one parent.


      Use REMOVE to correct a connection.
      Tap CONFIRM when the complete structure is ready.'
    root: A
    target: 
    difficulty: 1
    type: 1
    identification: 0
    nodes:
    - id: A
      position: {x: 0, y: 1}
    - id: B
      position: {x: -0.5, y: 0.5}
    - id: C
      position: {x: 0.5, y: 0.5}
    - id: D
      position: {x: -0.8, y: 0}
    - id: E
      position: {x: -0.2, y: 0}
    initial: []
    required:
    - source: A
      destination: B
      removable: 1
    - source: A
      destination: C
      removable: 1
    - source: B
      destination: D
      removable: 1
    - source: B
      destination: E
      removable: 1
  - title: Repair the broken tree
    objective: Repair the tree so E is a child of B. Keep the other parent links.
    lesson: 'Select the endpoints of an incorrect branch and tap REMOVE. Select the
      new parent and child, then CONNECT.


      A correction must remove the old
      parent link before adding the new one.'
    root: A
    target: 
    difficulty: 1
    type: 2
    identification: 0
    nodes:
    - id: A
      position: {x: 0, y: 1}
    - id: B
      position: {x: -0.5, y: 0.5}
    - id: C
      position: {x: 0.5, y: 0.5}
    - id: D
      position: {x: -0.8, y: 0}
    - id: E
      position: {x: -0.2, y: 0}
    initial:
    - source: A
      destination: B
      removable: 1
    - source: A
      destination: C
      removable: 1
    - source: B
      destination: D
      removable: 1
    - source: C
      destination: E
      removable: 1
    required:
    - source: A
      destination: B
      removable: 1
    - source: A
      destination: C
      removable: 1
    - source: B
      destination: D
      removable: 1
    - source: B
      destination: E
      removable: 1
  - title: Tree depth
    objective: What is the depth of node F?
    lesson: 'Root depth and level are 0. Depth counts edges from the root to a node.
      Height is the longest root-to-leaf path, also counted in edges.


      Choose
      a number, then confirm.'
    root: A
    target: F
    difficulty: 1
    type: 3
    identification: 0
    nodes:
    - id: A
      position: {x: 0, y: 1}
    - id: B
      position: {x: -0.5, y: 0.67}
